---
import SecondaryLayout from '../layouts/SecondaryLayout.astro';
---
<SecondaryLayout title="Tentang VANNDIK" description="Kenali Ibrahim William Vanndik, founder VANNDIK, serta visi, misi, nilai, dan ekosistem digital VANNDIK." active="/tentang/">
  <section class="about-hero page-hero" id="top">
    <div class="about-hero-orb"></div>
    <div class="about-hero-inner">
      <div class="page-eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> THE PERSON · THE PURPOSE · THE PLATFORM</div>
      <p class="about-overline">SELAMAT DATANG DI VANNDIK</p>
      <h1>Membangun ide menjadi <span class="text-gradient">pengalaman digital.</span></h1>
      <p class="about-lead">VANNDIK adalah ekosistem digital yang dibangun untuk mempertemukan wawasan, teknologi, kreativitas, dan peluang dalam satu tempat. Sebuah ruang untuk belajar, menemukan inspirasi, mencoba hal baru, dan terus berkembang.</p>
      <div class="about-hero-actions"><a class="about-primary" href="#explore">Jelajahi VANNDIK <span>↗</span></a><a class="about-secondary" href="#founder">Kenali founder <span>↓</span></a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="about-hero-side"><span>INDEPENDENT DIGITAL ECOSYSTEM</span><b>IDEAS<br/>INTO<br/><i>IMPACT.</i></b><small>MEDIA · TECHNOLOGY · CREATIVITY</small></div>
  </section>

  <section class="founder-section" id="founder">
    <div class="about-container founder-layout">
      <div class="founder-photo-column">
        <div class="founder-photo-frame">
          <div class="photo-placeholder" role="img" aria-label="Tempat foto profil founder VANNDIK">
            <div class="photo-placeholder-grid"></div>
            <div class="photo-placeholder-mark">IWV<span>.</span></div>
            <div class="photo-placeholder-icon">＋</div>
            <div class="photo-placeholder-label"><b>FOUNDER PORTRAIT</b><span>FOTO AKAN DITAMPILKAN DI SINI</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="photo-frame-index">VANNDIK / FOUNDER PROFILE</div>
        </div>
        <div class="photo-guidance"><span>PHOTO TEMPLATE</span><p>Slot foto siap diganti. Rekomendasi: potret vertikal 4:5, pencahayaan rapi, latar sederhana, dan resolusi tinggi.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="founder-copy">
        <div class="section-kicker"><span>01</span><span class="kicker-line"></span><span>THE FOUNDER</span></div>
        <p class="founder-label">FOUNDER & CREATOR OF VANNDIK</p>
        <h2>Ibrahim William<br/><em>Vanndik.</em></h2>
        <p class="founder-intro">VANNDIK dibangun dari semangat untuk menjadikan ruang digital lebih terbuka, berguna, dan mudah dijelajahi. Melalui platform ini, berbagai ide dan kemungkinan digital dikembangkan menjadi pengalaman yang dapat diakses oleh lebih banyak orang.</p>
        <p class="founder-intro">Sebagai founder, Ibrahim William Vanndik mengembangkan VANNDIK sebagai wadah jangka panjang yang terus bertumbuh—menghubungkan konten, teknologi, kreativitas, dan peluang digital dalam satu identitas.</p>
        <div class="founder-signature"><span>BUILD WITH PURPOSE.</span><b>IBRAHIM WILLIAM VANNDIK</b></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="story-section">
    <div class="about-container story-layout">
      <div>
        <div class="section-kicker"><span>02</span><span class="kicker-line"></span><span>WHY VANNDIK EXISTS</span></div>
        <h2>Satu ruang.<br/><em>Banyak kemungkinan.</em></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="story-body">
        <p class="story-highlight">Dunia digital terus berkembang. Informasi, alat kerja, inspirasi, dan peluang tersebar di banyak tempat. VANNDIK hadir dengan gagasan untuk menghubungkan berbagai hal tersebut melalui satu pengalaman yang lebih terarah.</p>
        <p>Website ini dibuat sebagai pusat eksplorasi digital: tempat pengunjung dapat membaca, mencari referensi, menemukan produk, mengenal tools, dan mengikuti perkembangan berbagai ide serta teknologi.</p>
        <p>VANNDIK bukan sekadar kumpulan halaman. Ini adalah ekosistem yang dibangun secara bertahap, dengan ruang untuk terus belajar, bereksperimen, dan menghadirkan sesuatu yang bermanfaat.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="purpose-section">
    <div class="about-container">
      <div class="section-kicker"><span>03</span><span class="kicker-line"></span><span>OUR DIRECTION</span></div>
      <div class="purpose-heading"><h2>Arah yang kami tuju<span>.</span></h2><p>Fondasi yang menjadi panduan dalam membangun dan mengembangkan VANNDIK.</p></div>
      <div class="purpose-grid">
        <article class="purpose-card purpose-vision"><span class="purpose-number">01 / VISION</span><div class="purpose-symbol">◎</div><h3>Visi</h3><p>Menjadi ekosistem digital yang relevan, inklusif, dan bermanfaat secara global—menghubungkan manusia dengan pengetahuan, teknologi, kreativitas, dan peluang.</p></article>
        <article class="purpose-card purpose-mission"><span class="purpose-number">02 / MISSION</span><div class="purpose-symbol">↗</div><h3>Misi</h3><ul><li>Menghadirkan konten dan informasi yang bernilai.</li><li>Mengembangkan tools serta pengalaman digital yang mudah digunakan.</li><li>Membuka akses ke inspirasi, referensi, dan pilihan produk.</li><li>Membangun platform yang terus berinovasi dan dapat diakses lintas bahasa.</li></ul></article>
        <article class="purpose-card purpose-values"><span class="purpose-number">03 / VALUES</span><div class="purpose-symbol">✳</div><h3>Nilai utama</h3><p><b>Curiosity.</b> Selalu ingin tahu dan belajar.</p><p><b>Clarity.</b> Mengutamakan pengalaman yang jelas.</p><p><b>Creativity.</b> Berani mengeksplorasi ide.</p><p><b>Integrity.</b> Menjaga kepercayaan dan transparansi.</p><p><b>Progress.</b> Bertumbuh melalui perbaikan berkelanjutan.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="explore-section" id="explore">
    <div class="about-container">
      <div class="section-kicker"><span>04</span><span class="kicker-line"></span><span>EXPLORE VANNDIK</span></div>
      <div class="purpose-heading"><h2>Apa yang bisa kamu temukan<span>?</span></h2><p>Jelajahi berbagai bagian VANNDIK melalui satu pintu.</p></div>
      <div class="explore-about-grid">
        <a class="explore-about-card" href="/artikel/"><span class="explore-index">01</span><div class="explore-about-icon icon-blue">✎</div><h3>Artikel & Wawasan</h3><p>Gagasan, panduan, perspektif, dan pengetahuan untuk memperluas cara pandang.</p><b>Jelajahi artikel <span>↗</span></b></a>
        <a class="explore-about-card" href="/berita/"><span class="explore-index">02</span><div class="explore-about-icon icon-cyan">◉</div><h3>Berita & Tren</h3><p>Ikuti perkembangan teknologi, bisnis digital, inovasi, dan topik pilihan.</p><b>Jelajahi berita <span>↗</span></b></a>
        <a class="explore-about-card" href="/produk/"><span class="explore-index">03</span><div class="explore-about-icon icon-purple">◇</div><h3>Produk Pilihan</h3><p>Temukan referensi dan rekomendasi produk dari berbagai kategori.</p><b>Temukan produk <span>↗</span></b></a>
        <a class="explore-about-card" href="/aplikasi/"><span class="explore-index">04</span><div class="explore-about-icon icon-green">⌘</div><h3>Aplikasi & Tools</h3><p>Kenali tools digital dan aplikasi kreatif yang sedang dikembangkan.</p><b>Lihat aplikasi <span>↗</span></b></a>
        <a class="explore-about-card" href="/game/"><span class="explore-index">05</span><div class="explore-about-icon icon-purple">✧</div><h3>Game & Interaksi</h3><p>Ruang untuk hiburan, tantangan, dan pengalaman interaktif.</p><b>Jelajahi game <span>↗</span></b></a>
        <a class="explore-about-card explore-global"><span class="explore-index">06</span><div class="explore-about-icon icon-cyan">◎</div><h3>Pengalaman Multibahasa</h3><p>VANNDIK dirancang untuk menjangkau pengunjung dari berbagai negara dan latar bahasa.</p><b>Jelajahi website <span>↗</span></b></a>
      </div>
      <p class="availability-note"><span></span> Beberapa konten dan fitur masih dalam tahap pengembangan dan akan diluncurkan secara bertahap.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="roadmap-section">
    <div class="about-container roadmap-layout">
      <div><div class="section-kicker"><span>05</span><span class="kicker-line"></span><span>LOOKING AHEAD</span></div><h2>Terus berkembang.<br/><em>Selalu terbuka.</em></h2></div>
      <div class="roadmap-copy"><p>VANNDIK dibangun dengan orientasi jangka panjang. Pengembangan dilakukan secara bertahap, dimulai dari fondasi website, kualitas pengalaman pengguna, dan konten yang relevan.</p><div class="roadmap-points"><div><span>01</span><p><b>Explore</b> — memperluas konten dan referensi.</p></div><div><span>02</span><p><b>Create</b> — menghadirkan tools dan pengalaman digital.</p></div><div><span>03</span><p><b>Connect</b> — membuka akses dan pengalaman lintas bahasa.</p></div><div><span>04</span><p><b>Improve</b> — meningkatkan kualitas berdasarkan kebutuhan pengunjung.</p></div></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-closing">
    <div class="about-container closing-inner"><div class="section-kicker"><span>VANNDIK</span><span class="kicker-line"></span><span>WELCOME TO THE JOURNEY</span></div><h2>Temukan ide.<br/><em>Mulai eksplorasi.</em></h2><p>Terima kasih telah menjadi bagian dari perjalanan VANNDIK.</p><a href="/" class="about-primary">Kembali ke beranda <span>↗</span></a></div>
  </section>
</SecondaryLayout>

<style>
  .about-container{width:min(1120px,calc(100% - 48px));margin:0 auto}
  .about-hero{min-height:570px;padding:110px max(24px,calc((100% - 1120px)/2)) 95px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:50px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 75% 40%,#1769ff26,transparent 35%),radial-gradient(ellipse at 15% 90%,#a855f71a,transparent 34%),#05060a}
  .about-hero-inner{position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:690px}
  .about-hero .page-eyebrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
  .live-dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#39ff88;box-shadow:0 0 14px #39ff88}
  .about-overline{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#42d9ff;margin:37px 0 14px}
  .about-hero h1{font-size:clamp(44px,6vw,70px);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-3.8px;margin:0 0 22px;max-width:680px}
  .about-hero h1 .text-gradient{background:linear-gradient(100deg,#42d9ff,#1769ff 52%,#b66cff);background-clip:text;-webkit-background-clip:text;color:transparent}
  .about-lead{font-size:14px;line-height:1.95;color:#a2aec0;max-width:620px}
  .about-hero-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:25px;margin-top:32px}
  .about-primary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:24px;padding:15px 19px;border-radius:4px;background:linear-gradient(105deg,#1769ff,#7545ff);color:white;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;box-shadow:0 8px 28px #1769ff35}
  .about-primary span{font-size:16px}
  .about-secondary{font-size:11px;color:#42d9ff}
  .about-secondary span{margin-left:8px}
  .about-hero-side{margin-left:auto;min-width:215px;padding:24px 0 24px 26px;border-left:1px solid #42d9ff44;position:relative;z-index:2}
  .about-hero-side>span,.about-hero-side small{font-size:7px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:#8293aa}
  .about-hero-side>b{display:block;font:800 39px/.95 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-2px;margin:25px 0;color:#edf4ff}
  .about-hero-side>b i{font-style:normal;color:#39ff88;text-shadow:0 0 20px #39ff8844}
  .founder-section{padding:105px 0;background:#080a11;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(143,160,196,.13)}
  .founder-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.82fr 1.18fr;gap:90px;align-items:center}
  .founder-photo-column{max-width:410px}
  .founder-photo-frame{padding:10px;border:1px solid #a855f744;background:linear-gradient(145deg,#a855f71a,#1769ff0c);box-shadow:0 18px 65px #0006}
  .photo-placeholder{aspect-ratio:4/5;position:relative;overflow:hidden;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:radial-gradient(circle at 50% 35%,#24365b 0,transparent 42%),linear-gradient(145deg,#11182a,#080a11 70%);border:1px dashed #42d9ff66}
  .photo-placeholder-grid{position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(#9cb9e510 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,#9cb9e510 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:30px 30px;mask-image:linear-gradient(to bottom,black,transparent)}
  .photo-placeholder-mark{font:800 clamp(58px,8vw,95px) Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-9px;color:#e8efff;text-shadow:0 0 35px #1769ff55;position:relative}
  .photo-placeholder-mark span{color:#42d9ff}
  .photo-placeholder-icon{position:absolute;top:18px;right:18px;width:32px;height:32px;display:grid;place-items:center;border:1px solid #42d9ff66;border-radius:50%;color:#42d9ff;font-size:20px}
  .photo-placeholder-label{position:absolute;bottom:22px;left:20px;right:20px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px}
  .photo-placeholder-label b{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:1.6px;color:#eaf2ff}
  .photo-placeholder-label span{font-size:7px;letter-spacing:1.2px;color:#8fa2bf}
  .photo-frame-index{padding:11px 3px 2px;font-size:7px;letter-spacing:1.7px;color:#8191a9}
  .photo-guidance{margin-top:18px;padding-left:13px;border-left:2px solid #39ff88}
  .photo-guidance>span{font-size:8px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:#39ff88}
  .photo-guidance p{font-size:10px;line-height:1.8;color:#8f9cb0;margin:7px 0 0}
  .section-kicker{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:1.8px;color:#8798b0}
  .section-kicker>span:first-child{color:#42d9ff}
  .kicker-line{width:34px;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#1769ff,#a855f7)}
  .founder-label{margin:34px 0 10px;color:#39ff88;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:1.8px}
  .founder-copy h2{font:800 clamp(39px,5vw,58px)/1.05 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-2.8px;margin:0 0 24px;color:#f4f6fb}
  .founder-copy h2 em{font-style:normal;color:#a855f7}
  .founder-intro{font-size:13px;line-height:1.95;color:#a0adc0;max-width:600px}
  .founder-signature{margin-top:31px;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid rgba(143,160,196,.17);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
  .founder-signature span{font-size:8px;letter-spacing:1.8px;color:#42d9ff}
  .founder-signature b{font:700 10px Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:#dbe5f5}
  .story-section{padding:100px 0;background:#05060a}
  .story-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr;gap:90px}
  .story-layout h2,.roadmap-layout h2{font:800 clamp(36px,4.6vw,54px)/1.1 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-2.5px;margin:32px 0 0;color:#f4f6fb}
  .story-layout h2 em,.roadmap-layout h2 em{font-style:normal;color:#42d9ff}
  .story-body p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.95;color:#9ba8bb}
  .story-body .story-highlight{font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#e8eef9}
  .purpose-section{padding:100px 0;background:#080a11;border-top:1px solid rgba(143,160,196,.12);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(143,160,196,.12)}
  .purpose-heading{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-end;gap:25px;margin:25px 0 34px}
  .purpose-heading h2{font:800 clamp(32px,4vw,46px) Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-2px;margin:0;color:#f4f6fb}
  .purpose-heading h2 span{color:#42d9ff}
  .purpose-heading>p{max-width:360px;color:#929fb3;font-size:11px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}
  .purpose-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.12fr 1fr;gap:14px}
  .purpose-card{min-height:310px;padding:25px;border:1px solid rgba(143,160,196,.17);background:linear-gradient(145deg,#111522,#090b12);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
  .purpose-card:after{content:'';position:absolute;width:150px;height:150px;border-radius:50%;right:-90px;top:-90px;filter:blur(3px);pointer-events:none}
  .purpose-vision:after{background:#1769ff35}.purpose-mission:after{background:#a855f735}.purpose-values:after{background:#39ff8830}
  .purpose-number{font-size:8px;letter-spacing:1.6px;color:#8293aa}
  .purpose-symbol{font-size:28px;margin:30px 0 16px;color:#42d9ff}
  .purpose-mission .purpose-symbol{color:#c18aff}.purpose-values .purpose-symbol{color:#39ff88}
  .purpose-card h3{font:700 21px Manrope,sans-serif;margin:0 0 13px;color:#f4f6fb}
  .purpose-card p,.purpose-card li{font-size:11px;line-height:1.85;color:#9ba8bb}
  .purpose-card p{margin:0 0 9px}.purpose-card p b{color:#e4ebf8}
  .purpose-card ul{padding-left:16px;margin:0}.purpose-card li{padding:0 0 7px}
  .explore-section{padding:100px 0;background:#05060a}
  .explore-about-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:13px}
  .explore-about-card{position:relative;min-height:230px;padding:24px;border:1px solid rgba(143,160,196,.17);background:linear-gradient(145deg,#101522,#090b12);transition:transform .22s,border-color .22s,box-shadow .22s}
  .explore-about-card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);border-color:#42d9ff66;box-shadow:0 15px 40px #1769ff15}
  .explore-index{position:absolute;right:19px;top:18px;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:1px;color:#75869f}
  .explore-about-icon{width:39px;height:39px;display:grid;place-items:center;border-radius:9px;background:#1769ff17;font-size:20px;margin-bottom:24px}
  .icon-blue{color:#42d9ff;border:1px solid #1769ff66}.icon-cyan{color:#42d9ff;border:1px solid #42d9ff66}.icon-purple{color:#c18aff;border:1px solid #a855f766;background:#a855f714}.icon-green{color:#39ff88;border:1px solid #39ff8866;background:#39ff880d}
  .explore-about-card h3{font:700 16px Manrope,sans-serif;margin:0 0 9px;color:#f1f5fc}
  .explore-about-card p{font-size:10px;line-height:1.8;color:#96a3b7;min-height:54px;margin:0 0 12px}
  .explore-about-card>b{font-size:9px;color:#42d9ff}.explore-about-card>b span{margin-left:8px}
  .availability-note{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-top:25px;color:#8291a7;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.3px}
  .availability-note span{width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#39ff88;box-shadow:0 0 10px #39ff88}
  .roadmap-section{padding:95px 0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 10% 60%,#1769ff17,transparent 38%),#080a11;border-top:1px solid rgba(143,160,196,.12)}
  .roadmap-layout{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr;gap:80px}
  .roadmap-copy>p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;color:#9ba8bb;margin:0 0 22px}
  .roadmap-points{border-top:1px solid rgba(143,160,196,.18)}
  .roadmap-points>div{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;padding:13px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(143,160,196,.14)}
  .roadmap-points span{font-size:9px;color:#42d9ff}
  .roadmap-points p{margin:0;color:#a5b1c3;font-size:11px}.roadmap-points b{color:#f0f4fb}
  .about-closing{padding:90px 0;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 85% 30%,#a855f71d,transparent 35%),radial-gradient(ellipse at 10% 80%,#1769ff20,transparent 40%),#05060a;border-top:1px solid rgba(143,160,196,.15)}
  .closing-inner h2{font:800 clamp(43px,6vw,66px)/1.05 Manrope,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-3px;margin:25px 0 15px;color:#f4f6fb}
  .closing-inner h2 em{font-style:normal;color:#39ff88}
  .closing-inner>p{font-size:12px;color:#9ba8bb;margin:0 0 25px}
  @media(max-width:900px){.about-hero{gap:25px}.about-hero-side{min-width:165px;padding-left:18px}.about-hero-side>b{font-size:31px}.founder-layout{gap:45px}.story-layout,.roadmap-layout{gap:45px}.purpose-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.purpose-values{grid-column:1/-1}.explore-about-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}
  @media(max-width:650px){.about-container{width:calc(100% - 40px)}.about-hero{min-height:0;padding:75px 22px 65px;display:block}.about-hero h1{font-size:45px;letter-spacing:-2.6px}.about-lead{font-size:12px}.about-hero-side{margin:45px 0 0 0;padding:16px 0 0;border-left:0;border-top:1px solid #42d9ff44;min-width:0}.about-hero-side>b{font-size:27px;display:inline-block;margin:13px 20px 8px 0}.about-hero-side>span,.about-hero-side small{font-size:6px}.founder-section,.story-section,.purpose-section,.explore-section{padding:68px 0}.founder-layout,.story-layout,.roadmap-layout{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px}.founder-photo-column{max-width:380px;margin:auto}.founder-copy h2{font-size:43px}.founder-label{margin-top:26px}.story-layout h2,.roadmap-layout h2{font-size:39px;margin-top:24px}.story-body .story-highlight{font-size:15px}.purpose-heading{display:block}.purpose-heading h2{font-size:34px;margin-bottom:12px}.purpose-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.purpose-values{grid-column:auto}.purpose-card{min-height:0}.explore-about-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.explore-about-card{min-height:205px}.explore-about-card p{min-height:0}.roadmap-section{padding:68px 0}.about-closing{padding:70px 0}.closing-inner h2{font-size:46px}.about-hero-actions{gap:18px}.about-primary{padding:13px 15px;gap:14px}}
  @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.explore-about-card{transition:none}}
</style>
